## 23767-23780 · OpenViking vs MC design comparison investigation
The user directed me to spawn a GLM agent to investigate OpenViking (volcengine/OpenViking, ByteDance's "Self-evolving Context Database for AI Agents"), framing it as "looks like mc but more deterministic." I dispatched `29dbb3f9` on the normal GLM tier with a brief that made it test the hypothesis rather than confirm it — the load-bearing instrument was the determinism audit (which stages have no model call, whether any serve path replays stored bytes verbatim).

