I unified this into one historian capability — segment raw windows into semantic arcs, emit closure verdicts with consumption citations — applied at three sites: head folds (arc-aware cut points), mid-window dead-arc folds, and invizipburu v2 (note #92). Two laws preserved: contiguity (arcs stay contiguous ranges) and budget-as-chooser-not-cutter (selects among legal arc ends, never creates one).

The user raised two constraints:
